{"all_citations": "ps-2_smt, ps-2_smt.b, ps-2_smt.c, ps-2_smt.a, ps-2_gdn", "answer_text": "The organization: a. Assigns a risk designation to all organizational positions; b. Establishes screening criteria for individuals filling those positions; and c. Reviews and updates position risk designations {{ insert: param, ps-2_prm_1 }}.

